    interpreter_wrong_owner_arg_overload_fallthrough_2026_11_27, 0, "Pre-existing (Fable review 2026-11-27, fixture t7b). When an argument instance of another module same-named class is passed to a class-typed parameter, overload scoring rejects every candidate and select falls back to arity-only choice (interpreter_call/mod.rs ~1068-1075), so the call runs some overload instead of reporting a type error."

